msgid "TeraBee TOF RangeFinders"
msgstr "TeraBee TOF 测距仪"

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-one-rangefinder.rst:11
#: 261ab4f45e514b958c4ad783d4d621e1 5aa72f3bacf54f11bb8997d6d7bf095a
#: 62208557d1f5447eb62efc3b1d47bd3b d6a4f6a00f43471abc66610d3d909c60
#: d96b9d354a83498880f24841db2726fd
msgid ""
"The TeraBee EVO family of rangefinders are lightweight distance measurement "
"sensors based on infrared Time-of-Flight (TOF) technology. They are much "
"faster than ultrasound and smaller, lighter and require less power than "
"laser-based lidar but also have a shorter outdoor range."
msgstr ""
"TeraBee EVO "
"系列测距仪是基于红外飞行时间（TOF）技术的轻量级距离测量传感器。与超声波相比，其速度更快；与激光激光雷达相比，其体积更小、重量更轻、功耗更低，但室外测距范围也相对较短。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-one-rangefinder.rst:15
#: 46c8ad0326644816b254f2b9953120c1
msgid ""
"Specifications are derived from tests in controlled conditions. Bright "
"sunlight, target surface reflectivity and other variables will affect sensor"
" performance. The combination of very bright sunshine and low reflectivity "
"targets (such as grass) can reduce maximum range to 10m or less. For "
"additional information, please find the following "
"<https://terabee.b-cdn.net/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/TeraRanger-"
"Evo-60m-Test-Results-Report-Outdoor.pdf>`__"
msgstr ""
"规格参数来自受控条件下的测试结果。强烈阳光、目标表面反射率及其他因素将影响传感器性能。强烈阳光与低反射率目标（如草地）的组合可能将最大测距范围缩短至 "
"10 米或更短。更多信息请参考以下链接 <https://terabee.b-cdn.net/wp-"
"content/uploads/2019/04/TeraRanger-Evo-60m-Test-Results-Report-"
"Outdoor.pdf>`__"

